	(text "Buffer triggers at 1.65V\n\nDischarging Resistor\nC: 0.00001 F\nTime: 0.75sec\nV(0.75) = 1.65V = 5e^{-0.75/τ}\nln(1.65/5) = -0.75/τ\nR = -0.75/(0.00001*ln(1.65/5))\nR = 67649 ≈ 68k"
